  "post_content": "<p>El pintor Pere Ribera ha explicado la tarde de este jueves la exposici&oacute;n que presenta en Onda junto a sus alumnos y amigos Albert Escrig, Roig Planelles y Marcos Vicent a estudiantes de pintura de las actividades formativas municipales.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2014/04/IMG_9279.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>Ha introducido a Pere Ribera el especialista&nbsp;en arte de Onda Joan Feliu Franch. El grupo de estudiantes estaba acompa&ntilde;ado por sus profesoras, Bego&ntilde;a Molina, de t&eacute;cnicas mixtas, y Mari Carmen Vidal Casta&ntilde;, de pintura al &oacute;leo.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/pereriberaexplicaexpoondaactivitatsformatives/img_9268.jpg\" alt=\"img_9268\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/pereriberaexplicaexpoondaactivitatsformatives/img_9269.jpg\" alt=\"img_9269\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/pereriberaexplicaexpoondaactivitatsformatives/img_9270.jpg\" alt=\"img_9270\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/pereriberaexplicaexpoondaactivitatsformatives/img_9271.jpg\" alt=\"img_9271\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/pereriberaexplicaexpoondaactivitatsformatives/img_9273.jpg\" alt=\"img_9273\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/pereriberaexplicaexpoondaactivitatsformatives/img_9274.jpg\" alt=\"img_9274\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/pereriberaexplicaexpoondaactivitatsformatives/img_9275.jpg\" alt=\"img_9275\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/pereriberaexplicaexpoondaactivitatsformatives/img_9276.jpg\" alt=\"img_9276\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/pereriberaexplicaexpoondaactivitatsformatives/img_9277.jpg\" alt=\"img_9277\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/pereriberaexplicaexpoondaactivitatsformatives/img_9278.jpg\" alt=\"img_9278\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/pereriberaexplicaexpoondaactivitatsformatives/img_9279.jpg\" alt=\"img_9279\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/pereriberaexplicaexpoondaactivitatsformatives/img_9280.jpg\" alt=\"img_9280\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /></div>"
